      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16643/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine onion, parsley, butter, and minced garlic in a large pot over medium heat; cook and stir until onions are tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9DszXpzL3BhyQMwCA-4qgRpQ6GY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16643-creamy-corn-soup-DDMFS-step-2-BG-2723-8b3af21d7ac646cb9b2dec5d10adb266.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16643/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in flour to make a thick paste; whisk in milk and chicken broth until soup thickens slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LgK4SAk8bIfwfmMh0CXvMzGOOfM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16643-creamy-corn-soup-DDMFS-step-4-BG-2728-127676974d04448b9190588e33095613.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16643/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in corn and cream cheese until heated through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
