        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h1PIJeZIdQhcSfeeMzBnjhuvopU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16643-creamy-corn-soup-DDMFS-step-5-BG-2731-78c6e3a72e0e4e849a352d0633586553.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16643/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add garlic salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper to taste; stir until combined.",
      "section": null,
